OL,3,AOne of the year's most prolific meteor
OL,4,Ashowers to light up the night sky this
OL,5,Aweekend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Leonid meteor shower is set to
OL,8,Fdazzle sky gazers across the UK
OL,9,Fthroughout November.
OL,11,FThe celestial spectacle takes place
OL,12,Ffrom now until 30 November with the
OL,13,Fpeak taking place on the night of 17
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FThere could be the chance to spot up to
OL,17,F10-15 meteors per hour.
OL,19,FThe shower is made up of dust particles
OL,20,Ffrom the Comet 55P/Tempel-Tuttle, which
OL,21,Fleaves a trail of debris as it follows
OL,22,Fits path around the Sun.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
